 = parse_args()\n    if args.write_conclusions:\n        return _run_write_conclusions(args)\nlrwxrwxrwx 1 agent agent 121 Nov  6 05:11 /tmp/apply_patch -> /usr/local/lib/node_modules/@openai/codex/node_modules/@openai/codex-linux-x64/vendor/x86_64-unknown-linux-musl/bin/codex\n/workspace/investigation\n- next_action: Use the ready plan for constrained original-document retrieval only; do not broaden into prohibited-paper discovery or citation graphs, and verify dataset/model provenance plus bootstrap semantics before paper claims. Final status: reference_query_plan_ready.\n\n### 2026-11-06T05:11:49.095068+00:00 | step=paper | scope=paper\n- summary: Selected a thesis-first protected-reporting trade-off study rather than search improvement, a novel certificate method, or a universal superiority story. gate=kept; trigger=none; reason=This is a framing decision with explicitly bounded interpretation, not a newly validated scientific recommendation.\n- evidence: Independent final.qualification sources report completed/qualified/true. study sources retain the identical baseline with zero scored and three unscored attempts and zero search delta. Exact SHA256 match links task/evaluate_final.py to the final evaluator. Five final seeds each have eight cases. K=16 case means favor protected reporting over same-winner selector reuse; synthetic full-budget reporting has lower MSE than protected reporting. Real targets are 512-item finite audits. The bootstrap resamples subjects for selected-minus-fixed audit accuracy, not reporting bias. Candidate diagnostics are unverified; contaminated-copy independence=false is an intentional control, not a failed final qualification. Runtime identifies CPU SmolLM2-135M-Instruct and pinned MMLU-Pro. Local style is single-column 5.5 by 9 inches; bundled 2027 naming conflicts with VENUE ICLR 2026, so year branding must be checked rather than copied. No prior manuscript or resolved edit context exists.\n- next_action: Write mirrored strategy o