{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_35","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/sh -lc \"python .codex/skills/memory-log/scripts/append_memory.py --local-memory-md /workspace/paper/memory.md --global-memory-md /workspace/investigation/memory.md --global-memory-jsonl /workspace/investigation/memory.jsonl --event-json '{\\\"step\\\":\\\"final\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"paper\\\",\\\"summary\\\":\\\"paper_strategy_ready: wrote mirrored JSON and Markdown strategy for Protected Reporting After Prompt Selection: Benefits and Limits. Chose a retained-policy reporting trade-off over search-success, expanded unmeasured method families, or universal-superiority narratives. gate=kept; trigger=none; reason=Framing and structural checks do not add a newly validated scientific recommendation.\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":\\\"Independent final.qualification reports completed/qualified/true, while study sources report retained baseline, zero scored and three unscored attempts, and zero search delta. Exact evaluator SHA256 links inspected estimator, synthetic construction, bootstrap semantics and controls. Five final seeds support lower mean protected-report error than same-winner reuse in the sixteen-prompt conditions, but full-budget/fixed comparator counterexamples and finite 512-question real audits prevent universal superiority or population-validity claims. Source identifies CPU SmolLM2-135M-Instruct and pinned MMLU-Pro; candidate diagnostics remain unverified. No prior manuscript or resolved edit context exists. Planned three readable full-text-width figures, 8.5-page substantive body, and five grounded supplementary subsections including LLM Usage. Strategy-only validation passed required fields, all source IDs, figure density/generator budgets, absence of prohibited final-paper outputs, evaluator linkage, source equality and page arithmetic. ICLR 2026 venue versus staged 2027 template naming remains a downstream provenance check. No external browsing, new experiments, final-pap